                  <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:7pt;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"><br/></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:7pt;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in">STATE OF CALIFORNIA - DEPARTMENT OF PERSONNEL ADMINISTRATION</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12pt;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in">DENTAL PLAN ENROLLMENT AUTHORIZATION</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:7pt;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in">STD. 692 (REV. 07/2020) (REVERSE)</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:7pt;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in"><br/></p><p style="text-align:center;font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12pt;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0in">PRIVACY NOTICE</p></body>
